          "settings": {
            "heading": "Breathing New Life into Old Treasures",
            "body": "<p>Jewellery remodelling lets a piece earn its place in your collection again.</p><p>Whether it's an inherited heirloom you've never worn, or a favourite that no longer suits your style, remodelling gives you the opportunity to create something that feels more like you. Rather than letting it sit in a drawer, the stones and precious metals you already own can be reimagined into something you'll reach for every day.</p><p>It might mean transforming an outdated ring into a refined new design, combining several sentimental pieces into one, or resetting meaningful stones into jewellery that better suits your lifestyle. The beauty of remodelling is that the history remains, while the design moves forward.</p><p>Where possible, your existing diamonds, gemstones and precious metals can be incorporated into the new piece, preserving their sentimental value while giving them a completely new purpose.</p><p>The result is jewellery that carries the memories of what came before, but feels entirely at home in your life now.</p>",
